# Router fallback (implementation.md sec 5). Copy to .env and fill in.
# Used ONLY when the Reviewer's `agy` or Docs' `copilot` hits a quota / rate-limit
# / billing error. Restricted to Opus 5 or GPT-5.6 sol -- never DeepSeek/GLM.
# Leave blank to disable the fallback (errors escalate to Head instead).

ROUTER_BASE_URL=
ROUTER_API_KEY=
ROUTER_MODEL_REVIEW=
ROUTER_MODEL_DOCS=
